      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***Penthouse Apartment***\n\nA stunning 2-bedroom penthouse apartment with views over Dublin Bay, offering modern living in one of the city's most sought-after locations. This beautifully finished home combines spacious interiors with breathtaking panoramic views, providing the perfect balance of comfort and luxury.\n\nStep inside your 2-bedroom sanctuary, and you'll be enveloped by a calming Cashmere wall palette, beautifully complemented by the timeless allure of Derby Oak flooring. This unique fusion of colors and materials is a true embodiment of Scandinavian and Hygge design, boasting clean lines, natural elements, and a relentless commitment to coziness and style.\n\nSunlight streams through large floor-to-ceiling windows, filling your living space with warmth and vitality. Every aspect of the interior layout has been thoughtfully curated to create a welcoming and soothing environment, offering a retreat from the urban hustle and bustle.\n\nThe Oslo celebrates a deep connection with nature, inspired by its location at the base of the Dublin Mountains. We seamlessly integrate the urban environment with breathtaking vistas of the mountains and Dublin Bay. It's a place where city living coexists harmoniously with the serenity of the natural world.\n\nResidents of The Oslo enjoy exclusive access to our generous Garden Lounge, complete with a private garden oasis, where you can relax amidst lush greenery. Our expertly landscaped communal areas provide seamless connections to the LUAS transport system and the bustling Sandyford Business District, ensuring you're well-connected to the city's pulse.\n\nEach 2-bedroom apartment at The Oslo embodies the essence of natural, comfortable living. Our interiors showcase the finest in Scandinavian sustainable design, featuring natural fabrics and soothing colour schemes that evoke a sense of tranquillity. Stepping onto your spacious balcony, you'll be treated to front-row seats to the ever-changing beauty of the natural world throughout the seasons.\n\nThe Oslo is more than just a residence; it's a lifestyle that embraces the principles of Hygge, offering a haven of tranquillity, a connection with nature, and the simplicity of elegant, comfortable living. Welcome to The Oslo, where every day is an invitation to savour the beauty of city living in perfect harmony with nature.\n\nEvery apartment comes with complimentary WiFi and television package.\n\n**Please note: \n\n1) There are multiple property types available in this development. The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish. \n\n2) The rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types. Rents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents are listed here; please use those available at viewings. \n\n3) The overall BER Rating on this development is A2- A3. An individual BER cert for your specific apartment is available on move in, upon request. \n\n4) The amenity spaces are subject to varying completion dates and are tied in with the overall development completion time frame and may be subject to change."
